#: scenario3:scenario3_52D2A2A6_5BE3_4196_8586_D6BF70936841
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 59a6e7988b8c315f9fabcb9cbbb377aca4c65afda1791a36315d92cdb9c60560
#. default-sha256: 3d89b566794f4b995ffeaefbd17bc81a164e5215e9f04de376139ae8b3e5c93c
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_52D2A2A6_5BE3_4196_8586_D6BF70936841"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫The next morning, Jacopo stood alone in the den by the billiards "
"table."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫第二天的上午，⟪k:6⟫雅各布一人待在台球室中。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_A0F51FDE_0032_46B7_9E37_076DBD34C565
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 376e8f78feb62ffff777cc854740d8594a40fc9e3be4b068a73672198b9bde8f
#. default-sha256: b79a21d31d8e5a9722efc3aed3def8111b901c26192c4d2d9ba181feb290ac13
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_A0F51FDE_0032_46B7_9E37_076DBD34C565"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫He appeared to be rather agitated."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫此时他依旧显得焦躁不已。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_716AE35B_1F15_4014_A7EF_681027C6BBDE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 79cefd911b42d5a7bdc06660ffbbb78149bf8e982b0d848742976eab2fff6443
#. default-sha256: 6c01157ab110ea4d507992c8b3b37b5fa64da5ba8111bb25859127d1dee362d6
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_716AE35B_1F15_4014_A7EF_681027C6BBDE"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫His face was twisted into a frown, his pointer finger tapping restlessly against the hard "
"surface of the table."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫边用指尖敲击着台球桌的呢绒桌面，⟪k:1⟫边露出不悦的神情。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_61C40033_1D40_401E_B3A5_DE79C4FF4BE6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d76e2a8595ff0ce3a1b20c5141f20935b6404a8e13b0b67afd5a057a52c777e1
#. default-sha256: 1f8db1d91f39b1de3174e27562713cf4f94557afcf1e628a6d0a8dd78e26162e
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_61C40033_1D40_401E_B3A5_DE79C4FF4BE6"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Evidently no longer able to stay in one place,⟪k:1⟫he paced a circle around the table,⟪k:2⟫"
"then swiped up a rack and a cue,⟪k:3⟫setting up a game of nine-ball."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫在烦躁地围绕台球桌转了一圈后，⟪k:1⟫他用三角架摆好九个球的形状，⟪k:2⟫拿起了球杆。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_235FD550_CC68_4883_9BEB_73160CDB082A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 46e7a5bb8e0591e4e905797c1dfa04f2c1ec865e04e4a2b6dd4e2617f1077ce6
#. default-sha256: a178456b547232a430e2541c3a05fa567a4aac6f3383e570a101ea4ec7814f2f
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_235FD550_CC68_4883_9BEB_73160CDB082A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I am not intimately familiar with the ways by which men entertain themselves, but in truth, "
"I was bewitched by the sight of him leaning over the table."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫下仆虽然对于男士的游戏方式不甚了解，⟪k:1⟫但那时他架杆的姿势十分优美，⟪k:2⟫这的确是事实。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_C3DC4ABC_3CD9_4511_A4B2_7771DA2C2B1E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4c53dce5a5271b1d593858de4f30e37b267c835be8179037dfd8ff4d5c51f884
#. default-sha256: 053b8192cb019eb2285afdb53498449f078150b0080b805a766d48cffa3228a2
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_C3DC4ABC_3CD9_4511_A4B2_7771DA2C2B1E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It almost seemed as though a steel rod ran straight from his shoulder to the tip of his "
"outstretched finger, upon which the cue was secured by another finger looped over it."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫他将手指弯起被称为手桥的弧度，⟪k:1⟫仿佛一条直线贯穿般，⟪k:2⟫从胳膊到指尖伸得笔直。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_77C3C8BB_D837_4967_9254_8B45736A2CBB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bccf46d648b1a5195cdc378a0614ee1ddf045f6717aabf2b1fbf055fb9404793
#. default-sha256: 2e4ecd0bc65034fae594f63d21120ccbeea6e5278a519c03dd143ed5b678b340
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_77C3C8BB_D837_4967_9254_8B45736A2CBB"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫With a smooth, flowing motion, he thrust the cue forward slightly, pulling it back and "
"repeating the process once more..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫将球杆推出的一击，⟪k:1⟫平滑且没有一点抖动。⟪k:2⟫一次、⟪k:3⟫又一次缓缓挥动手臂——"

#: scenario3:scenario3_243CAC15_920E_473F_986D_47BC5C4EFD19
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a66c6e47e0feab7ef07a50c5131c030e43c040d0069db5ec4109418cc052a346
#. default-sha256: 88a82136bfd42e40c9ad21292d7427321798afbf165b08cc158d0aa7a351d87c
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_243CAC15_920E_473F_986D_47BC5C4EFD19"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫before ramming it into the cue ball, sending it rolling into the diamond of colored "
"balls. ⟪k:2⟫A chorus of ⟪k:3⟫click⟪k:4⟫s and ⟪k:5⟫clack⟪k:6⟫s emanated from the center of the "
"room."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫打出强而有力的白球，⟪k:2⟫高鸣着将五颜六色的球们打散，"

#: scenario3:scenario3_32B08C6F_C677_4FC8_A80F_B6F661D3B11D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 30aeaef72cc1731c5884ae66d902c2bb5c24e796d709be4748726e8e753cb959
#. default-sha256: cf6034e36c1a635aa915d59684dfb3b1cdbcd2e74129d763a3be4be3b0803b8b
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_32B08C6F_C677_4FC8_A80F_B6F661D3B11D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Balls collided with one another and ricocheted off the cushioned walls, a few landing in the "
"pockets situated around the edge of the table."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫球与球之间互相碰撞，⟪k:1⟫在桌边弹返，⟪k:2⟫数个落入袋中。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_9AD8D874_3530_497C_8B36_E1E928C2B206
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 05d316f4154119d4501839b619a70b5515eedb4973451a9acae62c041b016687
#. default-sha256: 703a881fec0bd82c9bf4897af2a29ba7116e548693c9fe29d9501f2ebc211c90
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_9AD8D874_3530_497C_8B36_E1E928C2B206"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Jacopo appeared to have accomplished this with little trouble, but I imagine merely striking "
"the cue ball with the stick would be rather difficult for someone inexperienced."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫虽然他打得游刃有余，⟪k:1⟫但如果是新手的话，⟪k:2⟫恐怕连将球杆击出都很难做到吧。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_87B9FABD_0AF8_4D8E_888C_A3CF4F854016
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9b4d7f8e41c5893291542bf81d0d5590ed382628bc5b8dfaea4aa91924257af6
#. default-sha256: 7647abf4e1693565665a8636545f800a124b18ed0df6fe02b552b21e4f528980
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_87B9FABD_0AF8_4D8E_888C_A3CF4F854016"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But despite his accomplishment, it seemed to only exacerbate his agitation."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫虽然表现得十分精彩，⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫他的表情却更显不满。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_959AC811_76E7_4738_9FCA_55B66A009317
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e986ac60357a495377252602587a518e7d820e0d390f747f7bd6c551a794a2b1
#. default-sha256: 59bc0c931e2d6ea37f0b0088bec8fc87da2956226f379e6c726dd0eb7fa93b2b
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_959AC811_76E7_4738_9FCA_55B66A009317"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫“Lousy positioning,” he muttered, though I hadn’t the faintest idea what he was talking "
"about."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫「布局不好」他这么低语道，⟪k:1⟫下仆并不能理解他所说的究竟是什么。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_E270133C_E277_4CB8_B4E3_B71C691D10D4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 33f57afc65b0b25798406ae45acbf805981debe12bda63efaf5fd03c2dffae70
#. default-sha256: d8c38cc9d93ebe647af641ef331b28fe83c36f12598feae014c78ab51b41313e
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_E270133C_E277_4CB8_B4E3_B71C691D10D4"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫What should have been a game for his enjoyment, he went about with a constant look of "
"exasperation."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫既然要娱乐的话只要好好享受就可以了，⟪k:1⟫他却一直一副严肃的表情。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_2FC95DA7_3AE1_4C19_AFD3_4BB7B16D0B44
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b1c7ccda6bbb8b2fad4f3f43030d8ebc8de87f613258a9d4da0c018ad18b3a8b
#. default-sha256: 8f484c4a1a5e5ceaf401cc099b82a90121a97e0369667c2982bb6b3d0b85854e
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_2FC95DA7_3AE1_4C19_AFD3_4BB7B16D0B44"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I suspect he was using it as a way to blow off steam."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫他一定是想通过这种方式，⟪k:1⟫让自己的心情沉静下来吧。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_51C47889_DC66_4189_9F8F_3FED3A536542
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b4cc156c39e359034ade506ab98be21c059dc6a354a79666006bcb02c42cd352
#. default-sha256: c97d976dff1332e808b655737168e6d45c01f22c9352b75853ff216841d45194
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_51C47889_DC66_4189_9F8F_3FED3A536542"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And as a result, the tension in the air was palpable."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫正因如此，⟪k:1⟫包裹着他的空气也有如箭在弦上般——"

#: scenario3:scenario3_A510D6AC_7F9B_44BF_85F1_D2C660EFBDFD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1b11f25cebcfc97ea514db8bfab41d0da6ccb0f74b579a93470ae2f4d8ec6273
#. default-sha256: 632a3c6a31c13635e2a83e941d8a44032654fb7df7a70509477bda65b35f997d
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_A510D6AC_7F9B_44BF_85F1_D2C660EFBDFD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I felt it would be improper to intrude upon him, even considering my distaste for the man."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫令人难以接近。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_D8E0D881_70AE_48C2_9AD8_14F49E160D98
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a87446808baa5aae86be5edba7bac519bd843708bc4633425715efd8ec7c47c5
#. default-sha256: cbef409fce7453f9caf456f12935458a8b2d662cc772a02906af82bc4fed486b
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_D8E0D881_70AE_48C2_9AD8_14F49E160D98"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫There was an undeniable beauty in every motion he made, every perfectly audible ⟪k:1⟫"
"clack⟪k:2⟫ of billiards balls bouncing off one another."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫下仆虽然谈不上对他有好感，⟪k:1⟫可是……⟪k:2⟫台球相碰的澄澈声响，⟪k:3⟫还有他的击球姿势都无比美"
"妙。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_798A17A7_980A_4A56_8ACE_528CA242B704
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fa5bed533179d2e804b75747ca7fbcc990d9ac839d2aae1b81a8100a1402b7c0
#. default-sha256: 113e10cae79997a53ae7013b529015c0f2406e3b3ea29bc785d4773a48819714
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_798A17A7_980A_4A56_8ACE_528CA242B704"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫It was... ⟪k:1⟫an enchanting sight."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫没错……⟪k:1⟫下仆在眼前这场景中，⟪k:2⟫感受到了某种微妙的气氛。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_D07E8173_C9AE_4047_83B1_A758FAD2AA4A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f643dcdcf3c0b2627c59535547cf3a2440af08aa84bcacae0001f0733cd208ad
#. default-sha256: 04a1847d966d61d242518bd7976cbc8c9cd050ca03de236f9a474ac6c4af13fc
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_D07E8173_C9AE_4047_83B1_A758FAD2AA4A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But then, someone without the slightest regard or appreciation for beauty came marching in "
"with a hammer to shatter it like glass."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫不过，⟪k:1⟫完全不能理解这种情趣的无礼之人，⟪k:2⟫偏偏在这时将他营造出的氛围破坏殆尽。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_7B37DB59_2906_47C3_8DB4_20B56BD5A096
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 39f45238acff769203e8e97e3d0b41367abe7a69a69f069a1fee433982975ad8
#. default-sha256: 75c3e1fd7b2e997b4cced834e07724a0e3de3c8c4ac750bc01981af7d28f1e6a
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_7B37DB59_2906_47C3_8DB4_20B56BD5A096"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Gotta say, that was pretty impressive."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫哎呀，⟪k:2⟫真是精彩。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_4312ACA6_E508_41CD_9B1C_5A5C8C3D221A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e71cc1c269d1997a8ef196024d4674208bbd2496a60069600ebb2e77b2800191
#. default-sha256: 268ba0be19d659dcb2178099d71d8e213b0c2290fe75afb9df65d5f40596758b
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_4312ACA6_E508_41CD_9B1C_5A5C8C3D221A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫...!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫………！"

#: scenario3:scenario3_53A099CE_6249_4467_BC84_4B848C0DE1D0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e299788051d27ea644fe8f5f52af4e524cc1c8ea29c714095939908ffdb81c62
#. default-sha256: 1bfcfa8eb5dfe50c3537359e0eabd20682b933f8db4a3eb0b9bd94a216061ba2
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_53A099CE_6249_4467_BC84_4B848C0DE1D0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫A man leaned against the frame of the open door—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫he was neither a resident nor "
"worker of the mansion."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫靠在打开的门上的是一位男性。⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫他并不是这座宅邸里的人。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_DEA168F3_64C0_4E53_BEE0_05349674E065
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 36f81c273df8187f37b4ede48fb4f2dd5ce19ab5d394193baa860e65d5e27df9
#. default-sha256: 663430faa4ad94dba62dd7f75dc1937fb0cd7166bd60160421910da18d74fd6f
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_DEA168F3_64C0_4E53_BEE0_05349674E065"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The man’s face was covered in scraggly stubble, his body draped in grime-caked garments. "
"⟪k:1⟫His eyes were sunken so deep it was as though I was looking at a fleshless skull—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫"
"though there was a feral glimmer in them."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫衣服脏兮兮的，⟪k:1⟫一副无精打采的懒散模样。⟪k:2⟫凹陷下去的眼窝如同骷髅般，⟪k:3⟫只有瞳孔中闪烁"
"着野性的光芒——"

#: scenario3:scenario3_F746C573_71F2_40C1_9A53_877C72A2260E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 580a7775bbdbade3f9cd5ace99f0b81dfd7b87e4875edcc1581f2066e9863b0e
#. default-sha256: fa4b0b6a481335b0f79126755a49e7c62d4c6cf18fc5691663d984edf122ac91
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_F746C573_71F2_40C1_9A53_877C72A2260E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Needless to say, he was not prim and proper."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫一言以蔽之，⟪k:1⟫他绝不是什么正经人。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_D45A122A_CE3C_4BB3_8488_C7FFF59FC7A7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 328fc56e8cadfca42859f8fb47c4f0262881ebe28b481f8498e28eb6e5dbf2a7
#. default-sha256: 0d6a34f2b1cc42de9f4af0500c9205f416c5cc4ea574021727c3a57d3704f86e
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_D45A122A_CE3C_4BB3_8488_C7FFF59FC7A7"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫How long have you been there?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫你什么时候来的。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_1D8BB6EE_B72B_4AE3_8BD5_1B75B210273B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 75b25b50d18721f77f7e79d4efd552c8bdd4c84d5c93c33e909abe9597de274b
#. default-sha256: 5ec210ada0f557e0919714776d0fa13132b16d0709c00f964afd0226890811de
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_1D8BB6EE_B72B_4AE3_8BD5_1B75B210273B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Not long. But man, I can’t help laughin’.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫You were ⟪k:6⟫"
"completely⟪k:7⟫ in your own world there."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫就在刚刚。⟪k:4⟫你完全没注意到啊。⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫不小心笑出来了。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_13D5D87F_9F1C_4BB0_8B1B_96D89F0B7219
